+## Accomplishments
+- Two new Supabase tables: brain.onboarding_sessions (lifecycle) and brain.onboarding_progress (per-channel)
+- onboarding.py engine with 5 functions + EXPECTED_FIELDS constant covering 10 profile categories (48 fields)
+- `onboard` MCP tool (10th tool in brain server) dispatching start/status/channel_update/complete
+- End-to-end verified: session creation, status retrieval with profile coverage gaps, all 10 brain tables in Supabase
