+1. **Task 1: Onboarding schema tables + state engine module** - `e329a33` (feat)
+2. **Task 2: Add onboard MCP tool to brain server** - `456adfe` (feat)
+3. **Task 3: Deploy onboarding schema to Supabase** - no commit (deploy-only, schema already in Task 1)
+
+## Files Created/Modified
+- `promaia/brain/schema.sql` - Added brain.onboarding_sessions and brain.onboarding_progress table definitions with indexes
+- `promaia/brain/onboarding.py` - New state engine: start_onboarding, get_onboarding_status, mark_channel_progress, get_profile_coverage, complete_onboarding
+- `promaia/brain/mcp_server.py` - Added 10th MCP tool "onboard" with _handle_onboard handler, updated docstrings from 9 to 10 tools
+
+## Decisions Made
+- EXPECTED_FIELDS defines 10 categories with 48 expected profile fields -- derived from onboarding research schema
+- Existing active/paused session reused (not duplicated) when start_onboarding called again; paused sessions auto-reactivate
+- Single MCP tool "onboard" with action parameter rather than separate tools (cleaner API, same pattern as "actions" tool)
+- No db_init.py modifications needed -- apply_brain_schema() reads the full schema.sql dynamically, so adding DDL to schema.sql is sufficient
